#######################################
# Allowlist
#######################################
# The context is the repository root but the image only needs the tooling
# workspace and the content it renders, so exclude everything and re-include
# those paths -- this keeps source/website/public/ (~37 MB) out of the context.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!source/content/resume/
!source/tooling/package.json
!source/tooling/scripts/

#######################################
# Generated
#######################################
**/node_modules/
**/export/
